of papers will be written on the subject, here's your chance to
get in on the ground floor.  Also it's easiest on us if the
first tasks are conceptually similar to a nonlinear statistical regression
task, like the rediscovery of Kepler's laws from orbital data (but
of course using modern unexplained data).

